    "bio": {
      "zh": "中国科学院沈阳计算技术研究所研究员、博士生导师。研究领域包括大数据、人工智能、知识工程与多模态数据处理。",
      "en": "Research professor and PhD supervisor at SICT, CAS. Research areas include big data, artificial intelligence, knowledge engineering, and multimodal data processing."
    },
    "email": "yubihui@sict.ac.cn",
    "image": "images/people/bihui-yu.webp",
