    "bio": {
      "zh": "负责实验室日常行政、科研项目辅助、经费报销、会议接待、档案与采购管理等事务。工作细致耐心，具备良好的组织协调和沟通能力，致力于为实验室科研工作提供规范、高效的服务保障。",
      "en": "Supports the lab’s daily administration, research projects, expense reimbursement, meetings and visitors, records, and procurement. With a careful, patient approach and strong coordination and communication skills, she provides organized, efficient support for the lab’s research."
    },
