    "bio": {
      "zh": "本科毕业于华南师范大学，硕士就读于中国科学院大学，沈阳计算技术研究所。研究方向为多模态推理，关注于 AI for education 应用。已有论文发表于 ACL MM 会议、JCST 期刊等。",
      "en": "Received a bachelor’s degree from South China Normal University and is pursuing a master’s degree at the University of Chinese Academy of Sciences, Shenyang Institute of Computing Technology. Research focuses on multimodal reasoning and AI for education applications, with publications at ACL MM and in JCST, among other venues."
